13
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,450
Open a Holy Machine Card Fragment

14
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,450
Let me get promoted

15
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:47,650
Unbox it for me

16
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:50,640
Congratulations to the survivors for getting cloth honesty

17
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,840
Press and smooth into eight

18
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,040
Wool times five

19
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,440
